# ---------------- electrolysis, Faraday ----------------
add(('2025', 'Jan', '2025-01-22', 1), 'elys', 'A solution of aluminium chloride is electrolysed for 30 minutes using a current of 2 A. The amount of the aluminium deposited at the cathode is ____ . [Given : molar mass of aluminium and chlorine are 27 g mol^{−1} and 35.5 g mol^{−1} respectively. Faraday constant = 96500 C mol^{−1}]',
    ['0.336 g', '1.007 g', '0.441 g', '1.660 g'], 1, lambda: near([0.336, 1.007, 0.441, 1.660], 2 * 1800 / F_ / 3 * 27), ['Q = 2 × 1800 = 3600 C; Al^{3+} + 3e^{−} → Al.', 'm = \\f{3600}{3 × 96500} × 27 ≈ 0.336 g.'], 'elys', 1)
